    <!-- Assistant engine replies. Commands are recognized in English and Portuguese; the examples are in Portuguese. -->
    <string name="assistant_help_body">**Commands (examples in Portuguese; English works too):**\n• **"analisar música"**: looks up curiosities and facts about the playing track\n• **"diagnóstico"**: inspects audio routes and hardware\n• **"equalizador flat"** (or rock, pop, jazz, vocal, graves, agudos…): applies a preset\n• **"mais graves"**, **"menos agudos"**…: moves the bass or treble control by 3 dB\n• **"timer de [X] minutos"**: starts a local timer\n• **"que música toca?"**: shows the current track\n• **"próxima"**, **"anterior"**, **"pausar"**, **"tocar"**: control the player\n• **"aleatório"**, **"repetir"**, **"favoritar"**: turn on the mode or save the track</string>
